{"id":"great-mosque-of-djenne","name":"Great Mosque of Djenné","qid":"Q683632","country":"Mali","locality":"Djenné","lat":"13.905277777","lon":"-4.555555555","built":"1906","year":1906,"year_text":"1906","century":"20th century","era":"20th century and later","period":"","date_basis":"Wikidata, inception","style":"Sudano-Sahelian architecture","heritage":"part of UNESCO World Heritage Site","type":"mosque","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Mosque_of_Djenné","text":"The Great Mosque of Djenné in the Sudano-Sahelian architectural style is the largest adobe brick building in the world. The mosque is located in the city of Djenné, Mali, on the flood plain of the Bani River. The first mosque on the site was built around the 13th century, but the current structure dates from 1907.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Mosque_of_Djenn%C3%A9","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-9465c3876d69","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"Great Mosque of Djenné 1.jpg","o":"gh-9465c3876d69.jpg","credit":{"text":"Andy Gilham","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Great_Mosque_of_Djenn%C3%A9_1.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-v--great-mosque-of-djenne","game":"civilization-v","name":"Great Mosque of Djenne","verified":false,"text":"The is a wonder in the Civilization games.","text_source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/Great_Mosque_of_Djenne","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-pbcec238d403","w":972,"h":568,"o":"gh-pbcec238d403.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization V, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Great_Mosque_of_Djenne_completion_art_(Civ5).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Wiman'Chec on 2023-10-09"}}]}]}